pdated_at":"2026-10-03T21:56:42Z"},{"id":608601019,"node_id":"RA_kwDONhAAJs4kRoO7","name":"jabridge_1.2.0_source.tar.gz.sha256","label":"","uploader":{"login":"Watchdog0x","id":84445039,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0NDQ1MDM5","gravatar_id":"","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":95,"digest":"sha256:b482ad7e608d27ff705f7f6cdf687c2de039773b54fcc0acd2c36a86b99e6be4","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-03T21:56:42Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T21:56:42Z"},{"id":608601025,"node_id":"RA_kwDONhAAJs4kRoPB","name":"jabridge_1.2.0_source.tar.gz.sig","label":"","uploader":{"login":"Watchdog0x","id":84445039,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0NDQ1MDM5","gravatar_id":"","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/pgp-signature","state":"uploaded","size":88,"digest":"sha256:a451c307926ee1ea194adfdb9cee6c3accc4ef54df5afb1c7dd1d6a31e7e56dc","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-03T21:56:42Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T21:56:42Z"},{"id":608600998,"node_id":"RA_kwDONhAAJs4kRoOm","name":"SHA256SUMS","label":"","uploader":{"login":"Watchdog0x","id":84445039,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0NDQ1MDM5","gravatar_id":"","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":295,"digest":"sha256:9ae3d6d4ce9f5ab8d37605f9eff7571c1673e9e86275d0c3cce0df1f805f7398","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-03T21:56:41Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T21:56:41Z"}],"body":"@vstoms added ANC, HearThrough and Off controls for Evolve2 85 in [PR #48](https://github.com/Watchdog0x/jabridge/pull/48). All three modes were tested on an Evolve2 85 with firmware 1.5.7 through Link 380. Direct USB remains untested. The mixed HearThrough mode and HearThrough level are not offered.\n\n```bash\njabridge settings set headset.noise-control anc\njabridge settings set headset.noise-control hearthrough\njabridge settings set headset.noise-control off\n```\n\nBash completion covers noise-control choices and the recovery command. Press Tab to see or finish a command. Run `jabridge setup` and open a new Bash terminal to load it.\n\nDebug reports now save to a new numbered file when an older report exists. The command shows the exact file to share. Reports also include clearer firmware errors and more USB and audio details.\n\nFirmware connection and recovery checks are improved. Evolve2 40 now opens its update interface, but preparation still times out before firmware transfer. A complete update remains unconfirmed. [Issue #43](https://github.com/Watchdog0x/jabridge/issues/43) is still unresolved.\n\nThere is also an experimental audio recovery command for Evolve2 30 SE connected directly by USB. Stop calls and recordings, keep audio playback running, then run:\n\n```bash\njabridge sound recover\n```\n\nThe command briefly opens the headset microphone, discards the captured audio and restarts playback. Audible recovery has not been confirmed. It does not fix the separate Linux kernel mixer problem from [issue #44](https://github.com/Watchdog0x/jabridge/issues/44).\n\nUpdate Jabridge and refresh device access:\n\n```bash\njabridge update\njabridge setup\n```\n\nDevice firmware is updated separately from the Firmware menu.\n","mentions_count":1}
